Implemented the boolean transform and future-cache handling. Also fixed premature report/cache writes on transform failure, registry-version reuse, inconsistent cached counts, repeated rules reads, and unescaped HTML. Added regression coverage.

**Verification:** `python3 -m unittest` passed all 23 tests. An instrumented run with two input files measured **1 rules-file read**.

**Trade-offs:** Boolean inputs are case-insensitive but must otherwise match exactly, so surrounding whitespace is rejected. Future-version caches are discarded in full, accepting a full reprocessing run. Writes are deferred until transforms validate; independent filesystem write failures can still leave partially updated artifacts.

